MID_LGV_3_M02_Kai_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Kai_m01_001: Your spear style's really similar to the one my dad\ntaught me.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Kai_m01_002: The form's a little different, but the feel of it's the\nsame. Almost like practicing with him.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Kai_m01: <BLN>Am I just imagining it?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Bel_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Bel_m01_001: Between all of the battles, rescue operations, and\nreconstruction work we've done, we are hardened.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Bel_m01_002: We've resisted Balor in numerous ways, and will\ncontinue to. So do not hesitate to call on us.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Bel_m01: <BLN>We are hardened.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dit_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dit_m01_001: Strange, isn't it? To think that so much would change\nso quickly. For the battlefield and people both.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dit_m01_002: You appeared and the light began to shine. Is that it?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dit_m01_003: They say good things come to those who wait. But\nyou kept us waiting too long.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Dit_m01: <BLN>Strange, isn't it?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tal_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tal_m01_001: I already knew the Order of Mithras was trying to\nrevive Balor.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tal_m01_002: But by the time I could do anything about it, their\nplan was almost complete.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tal_m01_003: This battle... My mother... There's a lot riding on\nhow this ends.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Tal_m01: <BLN>I knew...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Orh_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Orh_m01_001: Let's give it our all, Promised One. You're far from\nalone in all this.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Orh_m01_002: Now, one step at a time, but we will bring justice to\nFath—I mean, Balor!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Orh_m01: <BLN>Let's give it our all!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Seo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Seo_m01_001: I have now defeated Dagda the Great not once but\ntwice. Yet there was no satisfaction in it.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Seo_m01_002: In my hatred for him, I cannot overlook the feeling\nthat someone is toying with the souls of the dead.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Seo_m01_003: For the sake of Yu Phas, Keeper of Death and Night,\nwe must set this fallen world to rights.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Seo_m01: <BLN>Dagda the Great is no more...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Led_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Led_m01_001: I hate when men act vulgar—when they get violent\nand petty, and start talking nonsense.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Led_m01_002: There was a time when every lewd look they gave\nme would make me wish they were dead.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Led_m01_003: But...with the state of the world being what it is,\nit's harder to tell them to go to hell.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Led_m01: <BLN>I hate them.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Anh_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Anh_m01_001: I want you to know how encouraging it is for\neveryone to have you leading us.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Anh_m01_002: And I want you to know that if you have any issues\nwith your Mediator body, please feel free to ask.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Anh_m01: <BLN>Promised One!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tia_m01_001: We meet again, Promised One! I suspect I've\nchanged quite a bit since you saw me last.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tia_m01_002: Over the last few years, I've been accumulating a fair\nbit of experience as a strategist.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tia_m01_003: I'm here to serve you in your quest to bring peace\nback to the world.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Tia_m01: <BLN>We meet again...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Pet_m01_001: You really recognized me quickly, huh?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Pet_m01_002: Everyone else keeps telling me how surprised they\nare to see how much I've changed.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Pet_m01_003: I think maybe it's not so much because I've grown,\nbut because I've lost the baby fat.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Pet_m01: <BLN>You recognized me?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hur_m01_001: Even though it's in ruins, Dagsion still gives me the\nfeeling of being home.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hur_m01_002: You liberated Dagsion and I'm not sure I can say\nthank you enough.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hur_m01_003: Now let's all do something about the other gates to\nthe underworld too!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Hur_m01: <BLN>Dagsion...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Max_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Max_m01_001: Hello, Promised One! My name is Maxim Berman.\nWe're delighted to welcome you after all this time!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Max_m01_002: As a knight of Brezarant, I'll help you however I can.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Max_m01_003: Whether it's leading your battles or mending\nyour clothes, there's nothing I won't do to help!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Max_m01_004: {SetColor=Gray}I'll need to make sure the Promised One doesn't find\nout I was Jester...{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGA_3_M02_Max_m01: <BLN>Whatever you need!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Gol_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Gol_m01_001: Man, things are BAD. I'm fed up with it.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Gol_m01_002: Day in, day out, crushin' the risen dead... I'd love for\nthis to all be over.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Gol_m01_003: So, let's go crumple those gates! Bwahaha!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Gol_m01: <BLN>Bwahaha!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Gat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Gat_m01_001: Your outfit is so striking, Promised One. It suits you.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Gat_m01_002: It reminds me of the White-Maned Demon's hair\nduring battle... It's a color that always stands out.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Gat_m01: <BLN>The color white.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dan_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dan_m01_001: I'm well aware of your reputation. After all, you're\nmentioned in the prophecies!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dan_m01_002: I will be watching closely the assuredly drastic\nchanges that follow your return.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dan_m01_003: Indeed, some of them have already begun!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Dan_m01: <BLN>I'm recording it all!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fab_m01_001: It seems your return has set this land back to rights,\nPromised One.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fab_m01_002: Even the damnable sun has returned. Pity.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Fab_m01: <BLN>Oh, the sun...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Esm_m01_001: The world is a mess. No matter where you go, the\nstink of the risen dead follows you.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Esm_m01_002: When I'm fighting, I feel sick to my stomach the\nentire time.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Esm_m01_003: It helps to be close to you though. A little.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Esm_m01: <BLN>Ugh.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Urs_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Urs_m01_001: Now that you've returned to us, perhaps Vandahl\nTrading can finally get back to business.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Urs_m01_002: With risen dead roaming the world, the value of gold\nhas plummeted over the last few years.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Urs_m01: <BLN>Thank you for returning.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sim_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sim_m01_001: You know, there's something real special about\nyou, Promised One.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sim_m01_002: Oh, don't worry, I'm not trying to flirt or anything.\nIt's just kinda strange...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sim_m01_003: Usually people with years of battle experience carry\na kind of darkness with them.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sim_m01_004: But you... Your aura is warm and bright like\nsunshine. How do you do it?
MID_LGA_3_M02_Sim_m01: <BLN>How do you do it?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lou_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lou_m01_001: I did my very best while you were gone,\nPromised One.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lou_m01_002: But it was starting to weigh on me. No matter how\nmuch good I did, it never felt like enough...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lou_m01_003: But your return felt like a reward for my efforts.\nSo I won't quit now. In fact, I'm just getting started!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Lou_m01: <BLN>I'm just getting started!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fia_m01_001: Many people died while you were gone,\nPromised One.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fia_m01_002: Oh, I'm not blaming you! In fact, I actually blame\nmy own incompetence...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fia_m01_003: As many as I've saved, there were even more that I\nfailed to... I have to be better than this.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Fia_m01: <BLN>I can't forget them.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Die_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Die_m01_001: A world where Balor's power extends as far as\nthe eye can see... Disgusting.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Die_m01_002: But I feel a little better now that the capital has\nbeen liberated. Thank you, Promised One.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Die_m01: <BLN>Disgusting.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lor_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lor_m01_001: You can rely on me whenever you go into battle,\nPromised One.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lor_m01_002: All this time, until you arrived, I've fought to protect\neveryone I know who's in Credna's temple.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lor_m01_003: I've become a good warrior. So, I'm ready for\nany and all orders!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Lor_m01: <BLN>Rely on me!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Set_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Set_m01_001: No matter how chaotic the world may be, I'll\nfind it difficult to fully trust you.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Set_m01_002: I'm not sure if you're exploiting prophecy, going\naround as the Herald of the Pale Raven.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Set_m01_003: Many people do have faith in you—not only because\nyou have the power to defeat the Brimstone Lords.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Set_m01_004: I do admire your honest desire to help others, and\nso I'm choosing to believe in you too.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Set_m01: <BLN>I'd like to fully trust you, but...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nin_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nin_m01_001: Balor's underworld gates... I never thought that\nanyone could bring them down...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nin_m01_002: The spirits are telling me that you are similar to\nme in a way...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nin_m01_003: But I sense that you are...greater in other ways.\nThat I am certain of.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Nin_m01: <BLN>I sense that you are...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Bon_m01_001: Oho! It has been a long few years without any\nsightings of you, Promised One.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Bon_m01_002: I was heartened to see the beacon lit to signal our\ncounterattack. We can at last bring the war to them.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Bon_m01_003: Now that the true battle is ready to begin, I find\nthese old bones trembling with delight.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Bon_m01: <BLN>I tremble with delight.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tob_m01_001: Now that you're back, it's a real fight again!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tob_m01_002: I've had my hands full defending Saramis from an\nendless stream of the risen dead.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tob_m01_003: But taking down the enemy generals and their\nunderworld gates? Now you've got my attention!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Tob_m01: <BLN>I'm so excited!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lil_m01_001: I've been fighting nonstop these last few years.\nThere's no rest—they just keep coming.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lil_m01_002: I'm hardly even making any money out of the deal!\nLike everyone else, I'm just barely scraping by.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lil_m01_003: But with you back, my fingers are crossed that things\nare about to change. It's all riding on you now.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Lil_m01: <BLN>We're just barely scraping by.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lys_m01_001: The Promised One, hm? It'll be an honor to fight\nat your side.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lys_m01_002: My hair? Oh, I've been putting oil in it lately. I felt\ninspired by a certain someone.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Lys_m01_003: I don't know if I pull it off as well as he does, but I\nwas feeling daring.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Lys_m01: <BLN>I'm honored to fight alongside you.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Buc_m01_001: I cannot tell you how grateful I am for the three\ntimes you saved Lady Leda's life.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Buc_m01_002: And I will return the favor. Use the Demon Bear's\npower as you will.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Buc_m01: <BLN>I will return the favor.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sci_m01_001: Since the underworld was manifested I have\nbeen protecting Kalla.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sci_m01_002: But in light of the news that the imperial capital was\nliberated, she ordered me to join you.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sci_m01_003: My lady wishes to resolve this conflict as soon\nas possible. Let us join forces together and do so.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Sci_m01: <BLN>Together, we will triumph.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Moo_m01_001: Glad to see you again. I recognized you the moment I\nsaw you!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Moo_m01_002: I might be harder for you to recognize, but... Well,\nI had my reasons for disguising who I was.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Moo_m01_003: Anyway, this is who I am, and I'm looking forward\nto working together.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Moo_m01: <BLN>Glad to see you again.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Mic_m01_001: Honestly, after that fight in Dagsion, I keep thinking\nabout retiring.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Mic_m01_002: I'm just a human who aspired to be a warrior. And I\nfeel like maybe...I don't have it in me anymore.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Mic_m01_003: But when so many people are all counting on\nMikaela Redblade, how can I back down?
MID_LGA_3_M02_Mic_m01: <BLN>Honestly...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Oly_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Oly_m01_001: I have held fast to my conviction that there is no\nbeauty in destruction.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Oly_m01_002: And it has borne out. There is not a trace of beauty\nin this dying world.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Oly_m01_003: Perhaps followers of Balor would think there was.\nI do not.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Oly_m01: <BLN>I have held fast.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Naz_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Naz_m01_001: You defeated Dagda, and I feel great!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Naz_m01_002: And, if he gets resurrected again, there's really\nnothing to be afraid of.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Naz_m01_003: We'll just join forces with you again and defeat him\nas many times as it takes!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Naz_m01: <BLN>I feel great!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sar_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sar_m01_001: I can't believe it. You came to save us.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sar_m01_002: Is this a dream? I'm so afraid I'm going to wake up.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Sar_m01: <BLN>I feel like I'm dreaming.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dai_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dai_m01_001: When you didn't come back, I was worried you might\nhave died.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dai_m01_002: I'm strong, so I've survived this long. But I've had\nlotsa people die on me during my life.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Dai_m01_003: But you're still here, so I guess that makes you the\nsecond strongest around!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Dai_m01: <BLN>I thought you'd died!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hal_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hal_m01_001: Promised One! I'm so happy you're here in Dagda!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hal_m01_002: You've come to save everyone from the twilight of\nthe living, just like Jehoshaphat's prophecy!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hal_m01_003: You can count on me to help you out. I'm here, no\nmatter what happens!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Hal_m01: <BLN>I'm so happy!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Guj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Guj_m01_001: Hey! Know what would've happened if you'd\ncome back even a little later?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Guj_m01_002: I'd have already saved the world. But now you're\nhere. So, yeah. Go ahead. You take over!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Guj_m01_003: No need to thank me. Buy me a drink sometime,\nand we'll call it even.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Guj_m01: <BLN>Hey! Know what?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Yan_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Yan_m01_001: In these years of wandering, I've been thrashing the\nrisen dead—taking in the devastation everywhere.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Yan_m01_002: It occurred to me to swing by the capital here, and\nso now we meet!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Yan_m01_003: You think I was drawn by some beacon to rally\nhere? I doubt that. It is fate that brings us together!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Yan_m01: <BLN>We have a bond!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Iio_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Iio_m01_001: I wasn't able to achieve much before your return.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Iio_m01_002: I protected those I could, but it was so few.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Iio_m01_003: I'm sorry for that. I know I'm not the only one who\nregrets how little success we've had.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Iio_m01: <BLN>I have to admit...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Pep_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Pep_m01_001: Brigid's shamans have informed us that nature\nspirits are guiding those who will save Dagda.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Pep_m01_002: In hearing this, we now wonder if you are, in fact,\nsome incarnation of a spirit.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Pep_m01_003: If so, that would make us a hero who will help\nsave everything. We will march with you!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Pep_m01: <BLN>Our shamans have said...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Noc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Noc_m01_001: Luminous One! You are dazzling as the sun!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Noc_m01_002: So radiant...you fill me with energy!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Noc_m01_003: Thanks to you, I'm seeing smiles everywhere\nagain!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Noc_m01: <BLN>Luminous One!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sop_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sop_m01_001: So, there's still hope, huh? Even with the land of\nDagda as messed up as it is?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sop_m01_002: Now that you've shown up, Promsy, I feel like a\nray of light is shining through dark clouds.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Sop_m01_003: Things are going to get better and better—I'm just\nsure they will!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Sop_m01: <BLN>Things will get better!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Cat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Cat_m01_001: I'd be so grateful if you could give me a prominent\nrole in upcoming battles.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Cat_m01_002: Few have been able to take a stand against Balor.\nToo many were afraid to do anything.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Cat_m01_003: So, now, let's you and I save the world. Surely no\nthreat can stand against us.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Cat_m01: <BLN>I'd be so grateful...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ned_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ned_m01_001: Until you liberated the capital, I'd been roaming the\nlands, fighting the risen dead.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ned_m01_002: But now that your forces are going on the offensive,\nI believe it's a good time to join up with you.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ned_m01_003: My strength is yours for as long as it takes to defeat\nBalor. Deploy me any way you see fit.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Ned_m01: <BLN>My strength is yours.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Zac_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Zac_m01_001: Damn it... There's no getting a good night's sleep\nthese days. The end is right around the corner.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Zac_m01_002: That's been makin' me anxious for a long time.\nA good woman could help me relax some...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Zac_m01_003: But there's no gettin' cozy with anyone when the\nrisen dead are takin' lives left and right!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Zac_m01: <BLN>Damn you, risen dead!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Maj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Maj_m01_001: I hear people are doin' backflips, being all excited\nabout you showing up with all your promises.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Maj_m01_002: But I've been makin' a name for myself too. You'd\nbetter remember that!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Maj_m01: <BLN>Don't you forget it!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ven_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ven_m01_001: Why did you not come to us sooner? Disgraceful\nbehavior, not showing up on time!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ven_m01_002: All the hardship we've endured! And you, just\nshowing up when you feel like it!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ven_m01_003: Graaah! I'd put you in your place even more, but\nscolding you exhausts me...
MID_LGA_3_M02_Ven_m01: <BLN>Disgraceful!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ini_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ini_m01_001: I could hardly believe it when I heard the Herald\nhad finally appeared!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ini_m01_002: Just the idea of it calmed my troubled thoughts.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ini_m01_003: It's done me wonders. You've helped me reclaim\nmyself...in a manner of speaking.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Ini_m01: <BLN>It calmed my thoughts...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Jas_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Jas_m01_001: No matter how many fighters we've had, I knew we\ncouldn't defeat Balor. We lacked something.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Jas_m01_002: Until you arrived, Promised One. When I saw you,\nI knew what we'd been missing.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Jas_m01_003: I'm sure we'll have just what it takes to push back\nthe enemy now.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Jas_m01: <BLN>Something was missing.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ale_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ale_m01_001: Bucephalus knew you were here even before I did!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ale_m01_002: All of a sudden, he flew up in the sky. I was quite\nsurprised!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ale_m01_003: He just seemed so happy. And, of course, I'm now\njust as happy!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Ale_m01: <BLN>Bucephalus knew it first.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Cen_m01_001: Many lose their way because they do not consider\nwhat they are living for.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Cen_m01_002: Promised One, I implore you to follow Aurora's\nexample and inspire such people.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Cen_m01: <BLN>Inspire them.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Kir_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Kir_m01_001: When I first saw you, Promised One, I thought you\nwere a ghost.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Kir_m01_002: I thought to myself... Human, but not human...\nWhat could you be? Hmm.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Kir_m01_003: Well, as long as you're not a ghost, I really don't\ncare what you are.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Kir_m01: <BLN>I wonder why?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nuz_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nuz_m01_001: In just a few years, so many of the Har Hali have\njoined the risen dead.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nuz_m01_002: Many of them embraced death, claiming to be\nfollowing the will of the god Balor.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nuz_m01_003: But if this is his will, I have decided to reject him.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nuz_m01_004: I will not sit back and allow the souls of my kin to be\nswallowed up while former allies hack at each other.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Nuz_m01: <BLN>I will not sit idly by.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fot_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fot_m01_001: I note that life is returning to this city.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fot_m01_002: Thanks to the lot of you, it may someday be close\nto its former glory.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fot_m01_003: We have much left to do, but retaking Dagsion from\nBalor will be a comfort to those who have persisted.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Fot_m01_004: So for a moment, let us take pride in what we\nachieved here.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Fot_m01: <BLN>Life is returning to the city.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Kou_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Kou_m01_001: Are you alright, Promised One? Have the wounds\nyou sustained in the last battle been treated?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Kou_m01_002: You are the hope of this world. I know it's futile to\nask, but for everyone's sake, don't overstrain yourself.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Kou_m01_003: If I need to intercede, I will. You saved me, so I\nwould consider it part of my duty.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Kou_m01: <BLN>Are you alright?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tro_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tro_m01_001: Hong Hua has been throwing herself into the fray\nfor years on end.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tro_m01_002: She's still consumed with guilt for allowing Magistra\nRaksha to dupe her into killing so many people.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tro_m01_003: It wasn't until she met you that she began to feel\nanything again.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tro_m01_004: If you asked it, I think she would gladly die for you.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Tro_m01_005: That's why I ask you this, Promised One...go easy\non her.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Tro_m01: <BLN>Hong Hua...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nat_m01_001: If I weren't alive, I wouldn't be able to throw myself\ninto this battle.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nat_m01_002: What greater cause could a knight ask to risk his life\nfor than the fight for humankind?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nat_m01_003: And I can only be here because I listened to my\nfriend's words and chose disgrace over evil.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Nat_m01_004: Life certainly has its turns.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Nat_m01: <BLN>Only because I'm alive.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hri_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hri_m01_001: My family was not wealthy nor titled. Luck was\na factor, but I rose to the top by using my intellect.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hri_m01_002: And I felt a debt to King Hasdrubal, the man who\nsaw promise in me and made me a general.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Hri_m01_003: Nathan, on the other hand, is a man of loyalty from\na prestigious house. So we often clashed.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Hri_m01: <BLN>Where I came from...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ann_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ann_m01_001: You're this "Promised One" everyone's talking about?\nPleased to meet you, I'm Anna, a humble merchant.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Ann_m01_002: I've brought a whole host of goods for you brave\nsouls fighting the forces of the underworld!
MID_LGA_3_M02_Ann_m01: <BLN>Pleased to meet you!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Jun_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Jun_m01_001: It's been five hundred years since Solel and I\nkilled Dagda.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Jun_m01_002: After it was done, I withdrew from public life and\nsecluded myself in my temple.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Jun_m01_003: But I am standing up now because I believe I have\na responsibility to the world as we know it.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Jun_m01: <BLN>It's been five hundred years...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Mar_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Mar_m01_001: Even several years later, I struggle to believe my\nbrother Solel is dead.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Mar_m01_004: And the way he died... Both of his arms lost, his head\ncaved in.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Mar_m01_005: How was it that anyone—even our father—caught\nhim so badly off guard?
MID_LGV_3_M02_Mar_m01_003: How did that happen?
MID_LGA_3_M02_Mar_m01: <BLN>I struggle to imagine it.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Smi_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Smi_m01_001: Hi there. You look like you're doing well. You're\nwelcome here any time.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Smi_m01_002: I'd like to observe you—fighting the underworld—\nand take notes about your gallant bravery!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Smi_m01_003: But, really, as you're quite the singular figure, I know\nI'll be endlessly interested in you.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Smi_m01: <BLN>Doing well, I see!
MID_LGV_3_M02_Cla_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Cla_m01_001: I'm happy to see you again, Promised One. You\nlook busy as ever.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Cla_m01_002: How strange that you—one of the People of the\nWhite Egg—are leading this fight.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Cla_m01_003: It was a surprise to see a human who could destroy\nan underworld gate. I didn't think it possible.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Cla_m01: <BLN>Busy as ever...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Car_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Car_m01_001: Now that you've destroyed the underworld gate,\nthe deadlock is broken.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Car_m01_002: I'd heard about you from members of my family,\nwhich piqued my interest, of course.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Car_m01_003: Still, it's hard to believe you accomplished such\na thing. Even with Fortuna's blessing.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Car_m01_004: I never thought anyone would free Dagsion from the\nscourge of the gate.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Car_m01: <BLN>It's hard to believe.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Aur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_Aur_m01_001: I've just realized! With my return to the stage as\na goddess...
MID_LGV_3_M02_Aur_m01_002: I must take the time to greet all of my uncles and\naunts once again.
MID_LGV_3_M02_Aur_m01_003: We must work together in order to fully support\neveryone. And you, Promised One.
MID_LGA_3_M02_Aur_m01: <BLN>I've just realized!
MID_LGV_3_M02_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B01_m01_001: I happened to be away from the capital when Dagda\nthe Great put all its citizens to death.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B01_m01_002: I lost everyone—parents, siblings, even my closest\nfriends. And our house was razed to the ground.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B01_m01_003: Everything has been so bleak since then. I often\nwonder if I'd be better off having died with them.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B01_m01: <BLN>It's all been so bleak.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B02_m01_001: Is it safe here? I mean, really safe? No one will try\nto kill me?
MID_LGV_3_M02_B02_m01_002: Can I sleep here? Is it OK to lie down and sleep?\nNo risen dead? My dad won't come for me?
MID_LGV_3_M02_B02_m01_003: If only Lord Solel were alive, then maybe my dad\nwouldn't have been killed trying to protect me...
MID_LGA_3_M02_B02_m01: <BLN>Is it safe here?
MID_LGV_3_M02_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B03_m01_001: Ah, Promised One. I came here from Laverna in the\nhopes of seeing you.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B03_m01_002: I beg you to save this world! All I can do is pray\nfor you.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B03_m01: <BLN>Promised One...
MID_LGV_3_M02_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B04_m01_001: I'm finally breathing easier now that you've liberated\nthe capital, Promised One.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B04_m01_002: Say, how's the drinking water here? At my village,\nthe river was running with blood.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B04_m01: <BLN>I'm breathing easier now.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B05_m01_001: Damn my grandson for dying before me...
MID_LGV_3_M02_B05_m01_002: If he'd held out just a little longer, we could have\nboth taken refuge here together...
MID_LGA_3_M02_B05_m01: <BLN>My dear, dear grandson...
MID_LGV_3_M02_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B06_m01_001: Everyone is starving. As soon as people spot a\nmerchant, they chase us around. It gets annoying.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B06_m01_002: They don't care that I don't have much to sell them.\nIt's all I can do to feed myself, let alone anyone else.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B06_m01: <BLN>Just gotta...catch my breath...
MID_LGV_3_M02_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B07_m01_001: First Dagda the Great, now Balor... The world's in\nchaos. How many years have we endured?
MID_LGV_3_M02_B07_m01_002: The gods weren't fit to rule over anyone. We were\nfools to have worshipped them.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B07_m01: <BLN>The world's in chaos!
MID_LGV_3_M02_B08_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B08_m01_001: I've been in the habit of praying since I was a kid.\nI still can't help myself if I see a temple.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B08_m01_002: I don't know if there's any point to it now. But I'd\nstill feel uneasy about stopping after so long.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B08_m01: <BLN>Prayer's a hard habit to break.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B09_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B09_m01_001: It's good that I survived long enough to take refuge\nhere, but I have no idea what comes next.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B09_m01_002: I don't want to see the world destroyed. But I feel\nlike I personally have been through enough.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B09_m01: <BLN>What comes next for me?
MID_LGV_3_M02_B10_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B10_m01_001: Bah. Yes, the capital's been "liberated," but it's still\nin a rather sorry state.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B10_m01_002: "Capital" of what, I ask you. No authority rules here!\nHow can we even be certain it's safe?
MID_LGA_3_M02_B10_m01: <BLN>How can we be certain it's safe?
MID_LGV_3_M02_B11_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B11_m01_001: My dream was to become a great dancer, but I\nhurt my leg.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B11_m01_002: I'm walking now after some therapy, but it doesn't\nlook like I'll ever dance again.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B11_m01_003: So...if any of your plans need a decoy, let me be the\nfirst to volunteer.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B11_m01: <BLN>If it would help...
MID_LGV_3_M02_B12_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B12_m01_001: Whoa, you're the Promised One! How's it going?
MID_LGV_3_M02_B12_m01_002: I just got done playing tag. Sorry if you wanted to\nplay too. Maybe next time!
MID_LGA_3_M02_B12_m01: <BLN>You're the Promised One!
MID_LGV_3_M02_B13_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B13_m01_001: When the war against Saramis broke out, I couldn't\nbring myself to join in. So I abandoned the temples.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B13_m01_002: The Shield of Dagda has always been on our side\nwhen it comes to protecting our nation, after all.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B13_m01_003: I don't regret what I did. Especially since those who\nstayed loyal to the Divine Emperor are dead now.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B13_m01: <BLN>I must confess...
MID_LGV_3_M02_B14_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B14_m01_001: I've become a shipwright, just like I dreamed.\nBut this isn't how I imagined it going.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B14_m01_002: Instead of setting off to explore, the people who\nboard my ships set out to do battle.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B14_m01_003: I'm almost glad my master, who let me flee at the\nstart of the war, didn't live to see this.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B14_m01: <BLN>This isn't how I'd imagined it.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B15_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B15_m01_001: Many years ago, when I came to see the sights of the\ncapital, I fell in love with the beauty of Lake Baal.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B15_m01_002: Now, that lake is full of floating corpses. Everyone\npitched in to try to fish them out, of course.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B15_m01_003: But their faces were so bloated that you couldn't\nrecognize them anymore. What a horror that was...
MID_LGA_3_M02_B15_m01: <BLN>What a horrific thing...
MID_LGV_3_M02_B16_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B16_m01_001: This ruined city is the famed imperial capital? Maybe\nI ought to steal a ship and try someplace else.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B16_m01_002: Even if it sinks along the way, drowning is a better\nway to go than the risen dead tearing me apart.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B16_m01: <BLN>This is the capital?
MID_LGV_3_M02_B17_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B17_m01_001: The Arago guesthouse is being used to house\nrefugees. It wasn't authorized, but it is necessary.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B17_m01_002: Of course, we accept people not from our nation too.\nWe want as many people as possible to survive.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B17_m01: <BLN>Our guesthouse is repurposed...
MID_LGV_3_M02_B18_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B18_m01_001: I grabbed a few of my fanciest outfits and fled\nstraight here.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B18_m01_002: Some have criticized me for not bringing food,\nbut I have no regrets.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B18_m01_003: If I could die at any moment, I at least want to go\nout looking fabulous.
MID_LGA_3_M02_B18_m01: <BLN>I regret nothing.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B19_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3_M02_B19_m01_001: I was once the proud head of my family, with vast\nholdings and a palatial estate. But it's all gone now.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B19_m01_002: No one here in the capital had heard of our house...\nwhich is fairly common for provincial nobles.
MID_LGV_3_M02_B19_m01_003: Everything I was responsible for no longer exists.\nSo what, then, is the purpose of my life?
MID_LGA_3_M02_B19_m01: <BLN>I lost everything...